WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Stress and studying. Small habits that help when school feels heavy.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.950
Break big tasks into small steps. Write the next step only. Then do that one.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.950
Take short breaks. Stand up, stretch, and drink water every hour.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.950
Protect your sleep. Put screens away before bed. Rest helps memory.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.950
Talk to someone. A friend, a teacher, or your school counseling office.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.950
Asking for help is a strength. You do not have to carry it alone.

